## About

{{ site.name }} ({{ site.alternateName }}) is a licensed residential property management company operating in Georgia and South Carolina. Principal Broker: {{ site.founder.name }}. Head Property Manager and contact for new owners: {{ site.contactName }} ({{ site.email }}). One phone line for owners, residents, and applicants: {{ site.phone }}. Office hours: Monday–Friday, 9:00 AM – 5:00 PM ET. McBride Property Management has managed rentals since 2023 and previously operated as Century 21 Magnolia Property Management; it rebranded in 2026. The brokerage behind it has served the CSRA since {{ site.brokerageRootsYear }}.

## Services Offered

- Property Marketing & Leasing
- Tenant Screening (background, credit, employment, rental history verification)
- Rent Collection (electronic payment portals, on-time enforcement)
- Maintenance & Repair Coordination (licensed/insured vendor network)
- Financial Reporting (monthly owner statements, year-end 1099s)
- Lease Management & Compliance (Georgia and South Carolina landlord-tenant law)
- Eviction Coordination
- Property Marketing on MLS, Zillow, Apartments.com, and Realtor.com

